      {
        "id": 602563,
        "name": "Antonio Carnovale",
        "username": "TY18",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/ty18/{size}/191443_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-10-20T16:05:26.914Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m Tony, an n8n builder from Turin, Italy. Before automation I installed windows and doors, so I build for businesses that work in the constructions world, and for the agencies that serve them.</p>\n<p><strong>What I’ve built and run</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lead system (in production):</strong> leads from web forms, trade-show forms and voice notes go into Postgres and arrive on Telegram as cards with status buttons. Automatic follow-up emails, an AI step that reads replies, a morning summary and duplicate detection. Tested end to end and demoed live to retailers.</li>\n<li><strong>Booking flow for dental clinics:</strong> Typebot + n8n with patient check, registration, book / move / cancel appointments, free-slot calculation, and confirmations through Twilio.</li>\n<li><strong>Self-hosted stack:</strong> n8n, Postgres, NocoDB, Docker and Caddy on my own VPS, with HTTPS and nightly backups.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What I can do for you</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lead capture, follow-ups and notifications (Telegram, Slack, email)</li>\n<li>Webhooks and REST APIs, data mapping, Postgres / Airtable sync</li>\n<li>AI steps that read, sort and draft, always with a human approval step</li>\n<li>Fixes and audits of existing n8n workflows</li>\n<li>White-label builds for agencies</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How I work:</strong> fixed price or milestones, documentation and a recorded walkthrough for every build. English and Italian.</p>\n<p>Portfolio and demos: <a href=\"http://cautomations.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">cautomations.com</a><br>\nContact: <a href=\"mailto:ty@cautomations.com\">ty@cautomations.com</a></p>",
